        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8220, Grade 1 Low Profile Squared Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Single Cylinder Grade 1 Deadbolt has a truly contemporary look that is perfect for modernizing any home. As a grade 1 deadbolt, it is the top of the line. It is 2.6 inches squared with a .5 inch projection. Choose from a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou'll find the quality, peace of mind and beauty you expect from Baldwin in every lock. A heavy gauge steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts gives this ANSI Grade 1, the highest level security, door lock both strength and durability that is backed by a lifetime limited mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a thumbturn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Single_cylinder.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"307\" height=\"141\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Single Cylinder Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8220 Squared Single Cylinder Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1: Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2.6\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional: STD 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" or THK 2\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2.75\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
