                "title": "Square Single Cylinder Grade 1 Deadbolt, Baldwin 8220",
                "description": "Baldwin 8220 Square Single Cylinder Grade 1 Deadbolt - The Square Single Cylinder Grade 1 Deadbolt has a truly contemporary look that is perfect for modernizing any home. As a grade 1 deadbolt, it is the top of the line. It is 2.6 inches squared with a .5 inch projection. Choose from a wide array of finishes.",
